{"step_index":1289,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:37:01Z","input_tokens":3258,"cache_read_tokens":45115,"output_tokens":2024,"thinking":"Analyzing `App.tsx` to identify necessary components for a clean rewrite. The import statements suggest dependencies on trading simulation logic, a header, core UI elements, balance displays, charting, a copy feed, and a trader bench UI. This will guide the refactoring.\n\n\nThe component structure outlines a clear hierarchy: simulation controls, a core \"Mastermind\" element, and key performance metric displays. The presence of trading data, controls for simulation state, and trader selection indicate the need for managing and visualizing the simulation's state and interactions. This suggests organizing the UI around these conceptual areas.\n\n\nThe structure reveals a division into logical sections: simulation controls, data display, and trader management.  This suggests that the rewrite should prioritize keeping these functional blocks as distinct, self-contained components.  Specifically, the layout hints that the stepped chart and copy feed should be integrated as a combined display unit for enhanced data presentation. The \"Trader Bench\" will handle trader interactions and selection.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import { useTradingSimulation } from './engine/useTradingSimulation';\nimport { Header } from './components/Header';\nimport { MastermindCore } from './components/MastermindCore';\nimport { BalanceCards } from './components/BalanceCards';\nimport { SteppedChart } from './components/SteppedChart';\nimport { CopyFeed } from './components/CopyFeed';\nimport { TraderBench } from './components/TraderBench';\nimport { Shield } from 'lucide-react';\n\nexport function App() {\n  const {\n    isRunning,\n    setIsRunning,\n    speed,\n    setSpeed,\n    balance,\n    startingBalance,\n    totalPnl,\n    pnlPercent,\n    pnlMultiplier,\n    tradesCopied,\n    lossesInARow,\n    firedCount,\n    traders,\n    activeTrader,\n    activeTraderId,\n    committee,\n    evolution,\n    currentThought,\n    selectTrader,\n    resetSimulation,\n    logs,\n    chartHistory,\n    marketCategory\n  } = useTradingSimulation();\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"min-h-screen p-3 md:p-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col gap-5\">\n      {/* 1. Header with clean branding, autopilot badge, speed multipliers, and pause/reset */}\n      <Header\n        tradesCopied={tradesCopied}\n        isRunning={isRunning}\n        setIsRunning={setIsRunning}\n        speed={speed}\n        setSpeed={setSpeed}\n        onReset={resetSimulation}\n      />\n\n      {/* 2. Unified Mastermind Beast Core (Pulsing Brain, Level Progression, 7 Internal Cognitive Lobes, Neural Thought Stream) */}\n      <MastermindCore\n        evolution={evolution}\n        committee={committee}\n        currentThought={currentThought}\n      />\n\n      {/* 3. Top Metric Cards (Balance, P&L, Operator with Win/Loss Glow Pills, 2-Strike Handbrake) */}\n      <BalanceCards\n        balance={balance}\n        startingBalance={startingBalance}\n        totalPnl={totalPnl}\n        pnlPercent={pnlPercent}\n        pnlMultiplier={pnlMultiplier}\n        activeTrader={activeTrader}\n        lossesInARow={lossesInARow}\n        firedCount={firedCount}\n        onManualFire={() => {}}\n        marketCategory={marketCategory}\n      />\n\n      {/* 4. Middle Section: Stepped Chart & Copy Feed */}\n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-5\">\n        {/* Left: Balance History Stepped Chart (7 Cols) */}\n        <div className=\"lg:col-span-7\">\n          <SteppedChart\n            history={chartHistory}\n            currentBalance={balance}\n          />\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Right: Streaming Trade & Evolution Feed (5 Cols) */}\n        <div className=\"lg:col-span-5\">\n          <CopyFeed logs={logs} />\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* 5. Bottom: Trader Bench Roster */}\n      <TraderBench\n        traders={traders}\n        activeTraderId={activeTraderId}\n        onSelectTrader={selectTrader}\n      />\n\n      {/* 6. Footer Disclaimer & AppSec Safety Notice */}\n      <footer className=\"mt-2 pt-3 border-t border-[#1a233d]/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono gap-2\">\n        <div className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-slate-400\">\n          <Shield className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400\" />\n          <span>Autonomous Mastermind Engine · 7-Lobe Neural Confluence · Sentinel 0.75% Risk · 15% Circuit Breaker</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <span>Grok Bot v3.0 (Monolithic Autonomous Mastermind)</span>\n        </div>\n      </footer>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nexport default App;\n","Description":"Refactor App.tsx to unify entire dashboard under the MastermindCore beast without clutter","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Users/dev/Documents/Antigravity/grok-bot-dashboard/src/App.tsx","toolAction":"Updating App.tsx layout","toolSummary":"Refactor App.tsx"}}]}
